# A book that cannot be opened (an empty .txt): page turns by key, swipe and tap must be refused
# safely, then HOME still works. Before the fix (audit AUD-009, 2026-11) the first NEXT crashed the
# system (page index read through a NULL page table). Content: tests/fixtures/content-bad (one empty book).
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 150dp          # the only book: first 108 px row
+3s      snap  cannot-open
+500ms   key   next
+500ms   key   prev
+500ms   swipe 85% 50% 15% 50% 250ms
+1s      tap   85% 50%
+1s      key   home
+3s      snap  home
+500ms   end
